{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1xfspTh69ED4x6VA2w8", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off after filing one bug. I did not test screen rotation or the Inventory screen, and I did not run a craft to completion.\n\n**Bug filed (confirmed by the developer):** On Profile, the Gear tab's \"View Combat Gear\" button opens Combat on the Dungeons section instead of the Gear section. I reproduced it twice.\n\n**What looked correct:**\n- **Mining ore list:** Ores run from lowest to highest required level, and the XP figures match the per-ore XP. The list ends at Gold Ore (Lv. 40), with nothing shown above it despite Mining 50.\n- **Crafting batch dialog:** For Bronze Bar, XP read +6 for 1 bar, +68 for 11 and +155 for 25. Typing 99 clamped to the 25 the ingredients allow.\n- **Gear slot choosers:**\n  - Every eligible item showed up, including all six bodies, in order of Def.\n  - Legs correctly showed \"No eligible items in inventory\".\n  - The ATK/STR/DEF totals added up after each equip.\n  - Equipped items stay listed in their slot chooser, which looked like deliberate behaviour.\n\nConfidence is moderate (0.6), mainly because of the untested rotation and Inventory screen."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 319, "cache_read_input_tokens": 49806, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 319}, "output_tokens": 421, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "de30cfbd-2d23-486c-b544-f9a0e254d0f9", "uuid": "e0e43b44-766c-4b5d-9408-b525525686b1", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T01:34:26.643Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1xfsd3bKfFJbNT8DEkE"}
